WEBVTT

00:03:59.730 --> 00:04:01.670
where we pull the rug out from under it

00:04:01.694 --> 00:04:03.187
and give it a checkerboard,

00:04:03.211 --> 00:04:05.625
and it even uses that strange
visual information

00:04:05.649 --> 00:04:09.227
and does its best to match the pattern
with a little ad-libbing.

00:04:09.563 --> 00:04:12.513
So other cognitive skills
are important, too.

00:04:12.537 --> 00:04:16.191
The squids have a different
kind of smarts, if you will.

00:04:16.215 --> 00:04:20.876
They have an extremely complex,
interesting sex life.

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:25.999
They have fighting and flirting
and courting and mate-guarding

00:04:26.023 --> 00:04:27.794
and deception.

00:04:28.131 --> 00:04:29.534
Sound familiar?

00:04:29.558 --> 00:04:30.607
(Laughter)